      "headline": "GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16 GB Touches $800+ Price Tag On Newegg, A GPU That Launched At $429 Last Year",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "The GPU apocalypse has officially started, as mid-range offerings are now approaching a $1000 price tag.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-16T08:04:14.308369+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "233473aacae0599a071d1c678bfa517582c65517b24fe02ab4a4faa5371f8ac3",
          "excerpt": "The GPU apocalypse has officially started, as mid-range offerings are now approaching a $1000 price tag.",
          "sentence_hash": "5e9e22e3f2406bc4b708d38d55ba4d13530342406d211caa5019fcdbbf90ca89",
          "anchors": [
            "$100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "NVIDIA RTX 5060 Ti 16 GB Crosses $800 on Newegg, Becoming as Expensive as RTX 5070 The NVIDIA RTX 50 series is quickly soaring in price as we see worsening DRAM availability.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-16T08:04:14.308406+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "233473aacae0599a071d1c678bfa517582c65517b24fe02ab4a4faa5371f8ac3",
          "excerpt": "NVIDIA RTX 5060 Ti 16 GB Crosses $800 on Newegg, Becoming as Expensive as RTX 5070 The NVIDIA RTX 50 series is quickly soaring in price as we see worsening DRAM availability.",
          "sentence_hash": "108cd650348459f499ed9074242f4a65fdea4606c0738c14213fa52ac0162dce",
          "anchors": [
            "$800",
            "$800 "
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "For months, we have been hearing reports about NVIDIA making new price adjustments as it is becoming difficult for GPU manufacturers to secure the memory supply at lower prices.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-16T08:04:14.308437+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "233473aacae0599a071d1c678bfa517582c65517b24fe02ab4a4faa5371f8ac3",
          "excerpt": "For months, we have been hearing reports about NVIDIA making new price adjustments as it is becoming difficult for GPU manufacturers to secure the memory supply at lower prices.",
          "sentence_hash": "112092cae194af3db78dbcef89e367faa6e051d2625dfd23a232fc49ec67a7cb",
          "anchors": [
            "becoming",
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Very recently, NVIDIA notified its board partners about a price hike for its GPU-memory bundle, which immediately resulted in significant price hikes for the GPUs.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-16T08:04:14.308468+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "233473aacae0599a071d1c678bfa517582c65517b24fe02ab4a4faa5371f8ac3",
          "excerpt": "Very recently, NVIDIA notified its board partners about a price hike for its GPU-memory bundle, which immediately resulted in significant price hikes for the GPUs.",
          "sentence_hash": "67366a8460d66b04c9f116ca78f7774ddae1237723da6ce8935450f97f00978f",
          "anchors": [
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "GIGABYTE, ASUS, and other major vendors quickly raised the prices for the RTX 50 series and RX 9000 series cards.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-16T08:04:14.308492+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "233473aacae0599a071d1c678bfa517582c65517b24fe02ab4a4faa5371f8ac3",
          "excerpt": "GIGABYTE, ASUS, and other major vendors quickly raised the prices for the RTX 50 series and RX 9000 series cards.",
          "sentence_hash": "6e3d3919a57fde424627489ab7dabead882a588c4711aed7b2b002dad246fcb5",
          "anchors": [
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "This has now caused some serious problems for the buyers, particularly for those who were happy to stay in the mid-range segment.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-16T08:04:14.308521+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "233473aacae0599a071d1c678bfa517582c65517b24fe02ab4a4faa5371f8ac3",
